===Notes===
*Beckon's overcome chance is cumulative. Each hit adds the percentage of the target's maximum life taken to the break chance, then rolls against that total.
**For example, two hits each dealing 10% of maximum life give a 10% chance to break the effect on the first hit and a 20% chance on the second.
*The movement chance uses a hidden counter with a randomized starting number rather than a separate random roll each turn. Each time the target acts, the listed chance is added to the counter(halved if they save against your Mindpower ). When the counter exceeds 100, it removes 100 and the target attempts to walk towards you.